OL,3,ASri Lanka court convicts 15 men over
OL,4,Adeadly Easter Sunday bombings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll the bombers who carried out the
OL,7,Fattacks died in the blasts.
OL,8,FInvestigators have previously blamed
OL,9,Fthe bombings on Islamist extremists,
OL,10,Fand the 25 men indicted were from Sri
OL,11,FLanka's Muslim minority. One died in
OL,12,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
